      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاجَةٌ مَاسَّةٌ</span></b>  (assumed tropical:)  <i>A want difficult of accomplishment;</i> or <i>pressing;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُهِمْةٌ</span>. (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَحِمٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَاسَّةٌ</span> (tropical:)  <i>Near relationship;</i> (S, M, A, * K;) as
also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَّاسَةٌ</span></b> . (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  [Also, as a subst., sing.
